id: heel-second-effect
name: Heel
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
choke: true
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: heel
fromEffect: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Heel's second effect, as a Maneuver: as the Grappler, a Grapple Check against your Grappled - won, they are Suffocating till
  they escape the Grapple.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: While you are the Grappler in a Grapple, as a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action, target a Grappled Character in your Grapple and make a Grapple Check against them. If you win, they gain the Suffocating Combat Condition until they escape the Grapple.

---

# Refused but as the Grappler (maneuvers.mjs whyNotLaunch); the Grapple Check against the one held (use-maneuver.mjs), settled
# - won, Suffocating till the Grapple ends (chat.mjs settleGrapple, endGrapple).
